// `forbidden` (403), `not_found` (404, workspace or branch),
// `request_too_large` (413), `conflict` (409:
// `expected_generation` is not the current generation, with
// `details.current_generation`; or deleting a path that is not a file,
// with `details.reason` = `path_not_found`; or a request with the same
// `Idempotency-Key` is still in progress, with `details.reason` =
// `in_progress`), `idempotency_key_reuse` (409), `blob_missing` (410, a
// referenced hash is not stored in this workspace, with
// `details.hashes` and `details.reason`: `not_uploaded` when the
// content was never uploaded to this workspace, `missing_in_storage`
